5,1,1,talk,Minako,,The current system is failing. We need to know the actual time cost before committing to a year.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,Agreed. I suspect the workload is skewed. I want to see where the usage and labor actually sit.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I just want to stop guessing if the bathroom is gross. It’s scary! I need a clear rule.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I worry about the small costs. Who buys the sponges? I want to know the monthly expense clearly.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,I care most about our peace. I want to know what arrangement keeps us talking nicely in a year.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
