35,2,1,talk,Minako,,A full pass takes over an hour. And the firm requires us to tidy first. It’s not a magic fix.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,The calendar shows two people away often. The kitchen mess comes from just three of us cooking.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Sakura,,The grout gets black in eleven days! And the fights start when someone forgets to clean.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"The spray costs 2,300 yen a month, and we buy it twice. Also, ""done"" means different things to everyone.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Servas,,The previous tenants split rooms permanently and stopped speaking. The fights here start with reminders.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Minako,,"@Benjamin, if only three cook, should they do more? But the time cost is high for everyone.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Minako, fairness isn't just about time, it's about usage. The absent ones shouldn't carry the same load.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Shizue, if ""done"" is different, how do we know when to stop? I just want it to look clean!","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Sakura, we need a shared standard. And we need to stop double-buying supplies. That’s a waste.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Minako, @Benjamin, if we split permanently, we risk silence. If we rotate, we risk resentment.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Minako,,"The firm’s terms mean we still have to prep. It doesn’t remove the time, just the scrubbing.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,A fixed rota might ignore the absences. Standing assignments might ignore the usage disparity.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Sakura,,I don’t want to guess! I want to know exactly what I need to do and when.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"A paid service might be best if we can afford it, but we need to settle the invoice fairly.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Servas,,The note warns against permanent splits. The chat shows reminders cause conflict. We need a system that reduces reminders.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Minako,,"I’m leaning towards a service, but only if it truly takes the time off my plate.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,I’m concerned about the cost and the prep work. A rota might be more flexible for absences.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Sakura,,I just want the bathroom to not be scary! Any plan that works is good to me.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Shizue,,"I worry about the 2,300 yen. If we pay a firm, will it be more? We need to be careful.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Servas,,Let us choose the path that keeps our friendship. I fear the silence of the previous tenants.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
